  "review": {
    "observations": [
      "Both 256-tile FOREST and CAVERN atlases, all 24 batch maps, and the sixteen TILEANIM_WATER rotation frames were visually reviewed; tiles $60-$ff remain text-reserved and the reviewed sheets contain no stray text-palette regions.",
      "FOREST and CAVERN bind source-owned TILEANIM_WATER tile $14 plus UpdateMovingBgTiles counter/direction semantics, while all four linked products contain byte-identical palette and attribute payloads.",
      "This is artifact-only content acceptance. Every reviewed map remains Yellow-presented behind the architecture-boundary fallback; no Color runtime admission is claimed."
